abstract: >-
  vxedge is a virtual zonal vehicle for OEM and Tier 1 engineers. Software updates, new functions
  and faults run as packaged experiments on one machine, and every result ships with its digests.
  5G network slicing onto zonal and central E/E architectures is one family of its measured cases.
